      <h1>Baijiu Flavor Wheel</h1>
      <p class="lede">Most beginners describe baijiu with one word: strong. A wheel replaces that word with twelve, and once you can name what you are tasting, the category stops being a dare and becomes a map.</p>
      <div class="article-meta">
